#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:8
msgid "**Stable-isotope fractionation and ledger lifecycle (`relic.scientific.isotopes`)**: stateless exact-partition binary fractionation calculators (`[I]`), the fail-closed `Level 0` runtime boundary `IsotopeHeartbeatFunctor` (`[N]`), and the retired legacy pool-tracker status (`[X]`)."
