#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:12
msgid "**General continuum and discrete cochain transport (`relic.scientific.transport`)**: finite-volume upwind advection, Fickian diffusion (at both `Level 3` open boundaries and its `Level 4` closed 1D dissipative port-Hamiltonian runtime point), and operator-split advection-diffusion."
