#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:38
msgid "Ratio, fractional abundance, and delta notation"
msgstr "同位素比值、丰度分数与千分偏差记号"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:40
msgid "For a binary isotope pair with heavy amount $M_h \\ge 0$ and strictly positive light amount $M_l > 0$ (for example $^{13}\\mathrm{C}/^{12}\\mathrm{C}$, $^{15}\\mathrm{N}/^{14}\\mathrm{N}$, or $^{18}\\mathrm{O}/^{16}\\mathrm{O}$), the isotope ratio $R$, heavy and light fractional abundances $(x_h, x_l)$, and per-mil $\\delta$ value relative to international reference ratio $R_{\\mathrm{std}}$ (VPDB, AIR-$\\mathrm{N}_2$, or VSMOW; Fry, 2006; Sharp, 2017) satisfy"
msgstr "对于重同位素量 $M_h \\ge 0$ 且轻同位素量严格为正 $M_l > 0$ 的二元稳定同位素对（例如 $^{13}\\mathrm{C}/^{12}\\mathrm{C}$、$^{15}\\mathrm{N}/^{14}\\mathrm{N}$ 或 $^{18}\\mathrm{O}/^{16}\\mathrm{O}$），其同位素比值 $R$、重/轻同位素丰度分数 $(x_h, x_l)$ 以及相对于国际标准参考比值 $R_{\\mathrm{std}}$（维也纳皮迪箭石（Vienna Pee Dee Belemnite, VPDB）、大气氮 AIR-$\\mathrm{N}_2$ 或维也纳标准平均大洋水（Vienna Standard Mean Ocean Water, VSMOW）；Fry, 2006；Sharp, 2017）的千分偏差值 $\\delta$ 满足"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:47
msgid ""
"\n"
"R = \\frac{M_h}{M_l},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"x_h = \\frac{M_h}{M_h + M_l} = \\frac{R}{1 + R},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"x_l = \\frac{M_l}{M_h + M_l} = \\frac{1}{1 + R},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\delta = \\left(\\frac{R}{R_{\\mathrm{std}}} - 1\\right)\\times 1000\\quad [\\text{per mil}].\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"R = \\frac{M_h}{M_l},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"x_h = \\frac{M_h}{M_h + M_l} = \\frac{R}{1 + R},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"x_l = \\frac{M_l}{M_h + M_l} = \\frac{1}{1 + R},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\delta = \\left(\\frac{R}{R_{\\mathrm{std}}} - 1\\right)\\times 1000\\quad [\\text{per mil}].\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:57
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Because $\\delta$ is a nonlinear ratio transform and lacks extensive additivity, mixing two reservoirs $A$ and $B$ conserves heavy and light masses separately ($M_h = M_{h,A} + M_{h,B}$, $M_l = M_{l,A} + M_{l,B}$); a total-mass-weighted average of $\\delta$ is only a small-$R$ approximation. Zero or negative light-isotope denominators raise a domain error without masking depletion behind arbitrary regularizers."
msgstr "由于 $\\delta$ 属于非线性比值变换而不具备广延可加性，混合两个储库 $A$ 与 $B$ 时须分别守恒重同位素质量与轻同位素质量（$M_h = M_{h,A} + M_{h,B}$，$M_l = M_{l,A} + M_{l,B}$）；对 $\\delta$ 做总质量加权平均仅在稀有丰度极限（小 $R$）下构成近似。当轻同位素分母为零或负值时，计算器直接抛出定义域错误，绝不通过任意正则化项掩盖枯竭状态。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:64
msgid "Stateless exact binary rational fractionation calculators (`[I]`)"
msgstr "无状态精确二元有理分馏计算器（`[I]`）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:66
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`relic.scientific.isotopes.fractionation` implements stateless calculation utilities (`IsotopeFractionationCalculator`, `Carbon13FractionationCalculator`, `Nitrogen15FractionationCalculator`, and `Oxygen18FractionationCalculator`, all `[I]`). Given product-to-substrate fractionation factor $\\alpha = R_p / R_s > 0$ (related to per-mil enrichment by $\\varepsilon = (\\alpha - 1)\\times 1000$ and kinetic isotope effect $\\mathrm{KIE} = k_l / k_h$), a total elemental flux $F$ leaving a donor pool of ratio $R_s$ carries product ratio $R_F = \\alpha R_s$ and is partitioned via the **exact binary rational formulas**:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.isotopes.fractionation` 实现了无状态计算工具类（`IsotopeFractionationCalculator`、`Carbon13FractionationCalculator`、`Nitrogen15FractionationCalculator` 与 `Oxygen18FractionationCalculator`，状态均为 `[I]`）。给定产物相对于底物的分馏系数 $\\alpha = R_p / R_s > 0$（对应千分富集系数 $\\varepsilon = (\\alpha - 1)\\times 1000$ 以及动力学同位素效应（Kinetic Isotope Effect, KIE）$\\mathrm{KIE} = k_l / k_h$），离开同位素比值为 $R_s$ 的供体库的总元素通量 $F$ 携带产物比值 $R_F = \\alpha R_s$，并通过 **精确二元有理分馏公式** 拆分："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:76
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"F_h = F\\,\\frac{\\alpha R_s}{1 + \\alpha R_s},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"F_l = F\\,\\frac{1}{1 + \\alpha R_s},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"F_h + F_l = F.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"F_h = F\\,\\frac{\\alpha R_s}{1 + \\alpha R_s},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"F_l = F\\,\\frac{1}{1 + \\alpha R_s},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"F_h + F_l = F.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:84
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Unlike the trace-abundance linearization $F_h \\approx \\alpha R_s F$, exact rational partitioning preserves total elemental mass $F_h + F_l = F$ identically for all $R_s \\ge 0$ and $\\alpha > 0$. The calculators also provide closed-system Rayleigh substrate evolution $R(f)/R_0 = f^{\\alpha - 1}$ for remaining fraction $f \\in (0, 1]$, Farquhar et al. (1982) $\\mathrm{C_3}$ photosynthetic $^{13}\\mathrm{C}$ discrimination"
msgstr "不同于痕量丰度线性近似 $F_h \\approx \\alpha R_s F$，精确有理拆分对一切 $R_s \\ge 0$ 与 $\\alpha > 0$ 均恒等保持总元素质量守恒 $F_h + F_l = F$。该组计算器还提供剩余底物比例 $f \\in (0, 1]$ 下的封闭系统瑞利底物演化关系 $R(f)/R_0 = f^{\\alpha - 1}$、Farquhar et al. (1982) 的 $\\mathrm{C_3}$ 光合作用 $^{13}\\mathrm{C}$ 同位素判别式"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:91
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta_{\\mathrm{C_3}} = a + (b - a)\\,\\frac{c_i}{c_a},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\Delta_{\\mathrm{C_3}} = a + (b - a)\\,\\frac{c_i}{c_a},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:95
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Mariotti et al. (1981) nitrogen kinetic fractionation relations, and Craig and Gordon (1965) evaporative $^{18}\\mathrm{O}$ vapor-ratio closures"
msgstr "Mariotti et al. (1981) 的氮动力学分馏关系式，以及 Craig and Gordon (1965) 的蒸发水汽 $^{18}\\mathrm{O}$ 同位素比闭合方程"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:98
msgid ""
"\n"
"R_E = \\frac{R_L / \\alpha_{\\mathrm{eq}}(T) - h\\,R_A - \\varepsilon_k R_L}{1 - h + \\varepsilon_k}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"R_E = \\frac{R_L / \\alpha_{\\mathrm{eq}}(T) - h\\,R_A - \\varepsilon_k R_L}{1 - h + \\varepsilon_k}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:102
