msgid "Prognostic multi-pool isotope state coupling across arbitrary Functor graphs is intentionally fail-closed until full component `UpdateItem` bindings, parent process ownership, and checkpoint-replay contracts are wired:"
msgstr "跨任意 Functor 计算图的预报型多库同位素状态耦合在完整组件 `UpdateItem` 绑定、父过程所有权以及检查点重放契约完成接线前，统一保持故障封闭："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:108
msgid "`relic.scientific.isotopes.functor.IsotopeHeartbeatFunctor` (`Level 0`, `[N]`) and `relic.scientific.isotopes.wire_isotope_tracker` reject execution before any simulator or `StateManager` mutation with `runtime_unbound`."
msgstr "`relic.scientific.isotopes.functor.IsotopeHeartbeatFunctor`（`Level 0`，`[N]`）与 `relic.scientific.isotopes.wire_isotope_tracker` 在对模拟器或 `StateManager` 产生任何修改之前即以 `runtime_unbound` 拒绝执行。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:111
msgid "The historical out-of-band `MultiIsotopePoolTracker` class has been deleted (`[X]`) because mutating private pool dictionaries outside `StateManager` violated single-writer provenance and conservation auditing."
msgstr "历史上在带外维护状态的 `MultiIsotopePoolTracker` 类已被删除（`[X]`），原因是在 `StateManager` 之外直接修改私有库字典违反了单一写入者溯源与守恒审计规则。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:115
msgid "General conservative transport Functors"
msgstr "一般守恒输运 Functor"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:117
msgid "All three Functors in `relic.scientific.transport` inherit `TransportMechanismFunctor`, assemble oriented face fluxes on finite-volume cochain complexes, emit integrated concentration increments via `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)`, and account explicitly for boundary fluxes and any configured non-negativity clipping residual $R_{\\mathrm{clip}}$ in the discrete volume ledger"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.transport` 中的全部 3 个 Functor 均继承自 `TransportMechanismFunctor`，在有限体积上链复形上组装有向面通量，通过 `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` 发出时间积分后的浓度增量，并在离散体积账本中显式核算边界通量与所配置的非负截断残差 $R_{\\mathrm{clip}}$"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:124
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\sum_i V_i c_i^{n+1} - \\sum_i V_i c_i^n\n"
"= -\\Delta t \\sum_{f \\in \\partial\\Omega} A_f q_f + \\Delta t \\sum_i V_i s_i + R_{\\mathrm{clip}}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\sum_i V_i c_i^{n+1} - \\sum_i V_i c_i^n\n"
"= -\\Delta t \\sum_{f \\in \\partial\\Omega} A_f q_f + \\Delta t \\sum_i V_i s_i + R_{\\mathrm{clip}}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:129
msgid "Finite-volume upwind linear advection (`LinearAdvection`, Level 3)"
msgstr "有限体积迎风线性平流（`LinearAdvection`，Level 3）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:131
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`relic.scientific.transport.advection.LinearAdvection` (`Level 3`) discretizes $\\partial_t c + \\nabla \\cdot (\\mathbf{v} c) = s$ with oriented upwind face fluxes (LeVeque, 2002):"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.transport.advection.LinearAdvection`（`Level 3`）采用有向迎风面通量离散平流方程 $\\partial_t c + \\nabla \\cdot (\\mathbf{v} c) = s$（LeVeque, 2002）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:135
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}c_i}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -\\frac{q_{i+1/2} - q_{i-1/2}}{\\Delta x_i} + s_i,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"q_{i+1/2} =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"v_{i+1/2}\\,c_i, & v_{i+1/2} \\ge 0,\\\\\n"
"v_{i+1/2}\\,c_{i+1}, & v_{i+1/2} < 0,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}c_i}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -\\frac{q_{i+1/2} - q_{i-1/2}}{\\Delta x_i} + s_i,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"q_{i+1/2} =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"v_{i+1/2}\\,c_i, & v_{i+1/2} \\ge 0,\\\\\n"
"v_{i+1/2}\\,c_{i+1}, & v_{i+1/2} < 0,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:145
#, python-brace-format
msgid "enforcing the ParameterManager-governed advective Courant limit $\\mathrm{CFL} = \\max_i (\\lvert v_i \\rvert \\Delta t / \\Delta x_i) \\le \\mathrm{CFL}_{\\max}$ and distinguishing periodic, closed no-flux wall, Dirichlet, Neumann, and open inflow/outflow boundary contracts."
msgstr "算子强制执行受 ParameterManager 管控的平流库朗-弗里德里希斯-列维（Courant-Friedrichs-Lewy, CFL）稳定性上限 $\\mathrm{CFL} = \\max_i (\\lvert v_i \\rvert \\Delta t / \\Delta x_i) \\le \\mathrm{CFL}_{\\max}$，并严格区分周期边界、封闭零通量壁面、Dirichlet 边界、Neumann 边界与开放流入/流出边界契约。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:150
msgid "Fickian diffusion: Level-3 general operator and Level-4 dissipative port-Hamiltonian point"
msgstr "菲克扩散：Level-3 一般算子与 Level-4 耗散端口哈密顿点"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:152
msgid "**General multi-dimensional open/bounded mode (`FickianDiffusion`, `Level 3`)**: `relic.scientific.transport.diffusion.FickianDiffusion` discretizes $\\partial_t c = \\nabla \\cdot (\\mathbf{K}\\nabla c) + s$ in cochain form $\\dot{\\mathbf{c}}_h = -D_h \\mathbf{q}_{\\mathrm{diff},h} + G_h \\mathbf{u}_h$ with harmonic face diffusivity $\\mathbf{q}_{\\mathrm{diff},h} = -\\star_K d_h \\mathbf{c}_h$ ($\\star_K = \\star_K^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0$) and explicit diffusion stability audit $\\mu = K \\Delta t / \\Delta x^2 \\le \\mu_{\\max}$ across 1D, 2D, and 3D supports (Crank, 1975)."
msgstr "**一般多维开放/有界模式（`FickianDiffusion`，`Level 3`）**：`relic.scientific.transport.diffusion.FickianDiffusion` 在一维、二维与三维网格支撑上将扩散方程 $\\partial_t c = \\nabla \\cdot (\\mathbf{K}\\nabla c) + s$ 离散为上链形式 $\\dot{\\mathbf{c}}_h = -D_h \\mathbf{q}_{\\mathrm{diff},h} + G_h \\mathbf{u}_h$，采用调和平均面扩散通量 $\\mathbf{q}_{\\mathrm{diff},h} = -\\star_K d_h \\mathbf{c}_h$（$\\star_K = \\star_K^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0$）并执行显式扩散稳定性审计 $\\mu = K \\Delta t / \\Delta x^2 \\le \\mu_{\\max}$（Crank, 1975）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:161
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Closed 1D source-free dissipative port-Hamiltonian runtime point (`Level 4`)**: Under the secondary constructor-conditioned certificate `constructor_selection = {strict_runtime_point: True, spatial_dims: 1}` ({ref}`FickianDiffusion strict runtime point <class-transport-diffusion-fickian-diffusion-strict-runtime-point>`, `Level 4`), `FickianDiffusion` restricts execution to a closed (periodic or zero-flux wall) 1D uniform grid of spacing $\\Delta x$ with zero boundary ports ($G_h = 0$) and fail-closed rejection of any nonzero `source_term`. Binding the quadratic $L^2$ storage functional and autograd effort covector"
msgstr "**封闭一维无源耗散端口哈密顿运行时点（`Level 4`）**：在构造条件次级证书 `constructor_selection = {strict_runtime_point: True, spatial_dims: 1}`（{ref}`FickianDiffusion strict runtime point <class-transport-diffusion-fickian-diffusion-strict-runtime-point>`，`Level 4`）下，`FickianDiffusion` 将执行域限定于间距为 $\\Delta x$ 的封闭（周期或零通量壁面）一维均匀网格，令边界端口为零（$G_h = 0$），并以故障封闭方式拒绝一切非零 `source_term`。绑定二次 $L^2$ 储能泛函与自动微分势余向量"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:170
msgid "H_h(\\mathbf{c}_h) = \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathbf{c}_h^{\\mathsf{T}}\\mathbf{c}_h, \\qquad \\mathbf{e}_H = \\frac{\\partial H_h}{\\partial \\mathbf{c}_h} = \\mathbf{c}_h,"
msgstr "H_h(\\mathbf{c}_h) = \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathbf{c}_h^{\\mathsf{T}}\\mathbf{c}_h, \\qquad \\mathbf{e}_H = \\frac{\\partial H_h}{\\partial \\mathbf{c}_h} = \\mathbf{c}_h,"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:172
msgid "the production finite-volume diffusion drift coincides identically with the canonical dissipative port-Hamiltonian structure ($J_h = 0$):"
msgstr "生产代码的有限体积扩散漂移项同规范耗散端口哈密顿（dPH）结构（$J_h = 0$）恒等重合："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:175
msgid "\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{c}_h}{\\mathrm{d}t} = (J_h - R_h)\\,\\mathbf{e}_H = -R_h\\,\\mathbf{c}_h, \\qquad R_h = \\frac{1}{\\Delta x^2}\\,d_h^{\\mathsf{T}}\\operatorname{diag}(K_f)\\,d_h = R_h^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0,"
msgstr "\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{c}_h}{\\mathrm{d}t} = (J_h - R_h)\\,\\mathbf{e}_H = -R_h\\,\\mathbf{c}_h, \\qquad R_h = \\frac{1}{\\Delta x^2}\\,d_h^{\\mathsf{T}}\\operatorname{diag}(K_f)\\,d_h = R_h^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0,"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:177
msgid "satisfying monotone storage dissipation"
msgstr "从而满足单调储能耗散"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:179
msgid "\\frac{\\mathrm{d}H_h}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -\\mathbf{e}_H^{\\mathsf{T}} R_h\\,\\mathbf{e}_H = -\\sum_f K_f\\left(\\frac{\\Delta_f c_h}{\\Delta x}\\right)^2 \\le 0"
msgstr "\\frac{\\mathrm{d}H_h}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -\\mathbf{e}_H^{\\mathsf{T}} R_h\\,\\mathbf{e}_H = -\\sum_f K_f\\left(\\frac{\\Delta_f c_h}{\\Delta x}\\right)^2 \\le 0"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:181
msgid "and exact discrete mass conservation $\\mathbf{1}^{\\mathsf{T}} R_h \\mathbf{c}_h = 0$. On every emitted step in this configuration, `forward()` executes `relic.computation.operators.iphs.IPHSStructureSpec.validate` at `required_level = 4` and records the live audit on `last_strict_iphs_audit` (van der Schaft and Jeltsema, 2014). Because no thermodynamic entropy functional $S_h$ or reversible-irreversible GENERIC cross-degeneracy is claimed for isothermal tracer diffusion, the certificate terminates at `Level 4` (with `Level 5` reserved for GENERIC entropy-coupled formulations)."
msgstr "以及精确离散质量守恒 $\\mathbf{1}^{\\mathsf{T}} R_h \\mathbf{c}_h = 0$。在该配置下的每一个输出时间步，`forward()` 均在 `required_level = 4` 等级上执行 `relic.computation.operators.iphs.IPHSStructureSpec.validate`，并将实时审计结果记录至 `last_strict_iphs_audit`（van der Schaft and Jeltsema, 2014）。由于等温示踪物扩散不声明热力学熵泛函 $S_h$ 或可逆-不可逆 GENERIC 交叉退化条件，其证书等级终止于 `Level 4`（`Level 5` 专用于含熵耦合的 GENERIC 表述）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:190
msgid "Combined advection-diffusion and operator-splitting accuracy (`AdvectionDiffusion`, Level 3)"
msgstr "平流-扩散耦合与算子分裂精度（`AdvectionDiffusion`，Level 3）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:192
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`relic.scientific.transport.advection_diffusion.AdvectionDiffusion` (`Level 3`) combines advective and diffusive cochain sub-flows ($\\mathbf{q} = \\mathbf{v}c - \\mathbf{K}\\nabla c$, cell Peclet diagnostic $\\mathrm{Pe} = \\lvert \\mathbf{v} \\rvert \\Delta x / K$) via configurable sequential (`\"sequential\"` Lie-Trotter, $\\Phi_D^{\\Delta t}\\circ \\Phi_A^{\\Delta t}$) or symmetric (`\"symmetric\"` Strang, $\\Phi_D^{\\Delta t/2}\\circ \\Phi_A^{\\Delta t}\\circ \\Phi_D^{\\Delta t/2}$) operator splitting (Hundsdorfer and Verwer, 2003):"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.transport.advection_diffusion.AdvectionDiffusion`（`Level 3`）通过可配置的顺序分裂（`\"sequential\"` Lie-Trotter 分裂，$\\Phi_D^{\\Delta t}\\circ \\Phi_A^{\\Delta t}$）或对称分裂（`\"symmetric\"` Strang 分裂，$\\Phi_D^{\\Delta t/2}\\circ \\Phi_A^{\\Delta t}\\circ \\Phi_D^{\\Delta t/2}$）组合平流与扩散上链子流（$\\mathbf{q} = \\mathbf{v}c - \\mathbf{K}\\nabla c$，网格佩克莱数诊断量 $\\mathrm{Pe} = \\lvert \\mathbf{v} \\rvert \\Delta x / K$；Hundsdorfer and Verwer, 2003）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:201
msgid "Symmetric Strang composition eliminates the leading first-order Baker-Campbell-Hausdorff commutator $[A, D]\\Delta t^2 / 2$, achieving $O(\\Delta t^2)$ splitting commutator error when paired with second-order sub-flow integrators such as `\"implicit_midpoint\"`."
msgstr "对称 Strang 组合消除了首阶贝克-坎贝尔-豪斯多夫（Baker-Campbell-Hausdorff, BCH）对易子误差项 $[A, D]\\Delta t^2 / 2$；在与 `\"implicit_midpoint\"` 等二阶子流积分器配合时，可实现 $O(\\Delta t^2)$ 阶的分裂对易误差。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:205
msgid "Under the default first-order explicit `\"euler\"` sub-integrators, local sub-step truncation error is $O(\\Delta t^2)$ per step, so the composite `AdvectionDiffusion` trajectory remains globally first-order $O(\\Delta t)$ even when `\"symmetric\"` splitting is selected."
msgstr "在默认的一阶显式 `\"euler\"` 子积分器下，单步局部截断误差为 $O(\\Delta t^2)$，因此即便选用 `\"symmetric\"` 对称分裂，复合 `AdvectionDiffusion` 轨迹的全局精度仍为一阶 $O(\\Delta t)$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/isotopes_transport.md:210
msgid "When transporting stable isotopes across spatial grids, callers transport the conserved heavy and light concentrations $(c_h, c_l)$ and reconstruct $\\delta$ diagnostically after transport, avoiding direct advection or diffusion of non-conservative $\\delta$ values."
msgstr "在空间网格上输运稳定同位素时，调用方应分别输运守恒的重同位素浓度与轻同位素浓度 $(c_h, c_l)$，并在输运步完成后诊断重构 $\\delta$，禁止对非守恒的 $\\delta$ 值直接施加平流或扩散算子。"

